@fact pell.apothecary
# en: Runs the drawers at Pell & Daughters. He taught three generations of the village to count drops.
text [0b856c] = 管着佩尔父女药铺的抽屉。他教会了村里三代人数药滴。

@fact pell.counting
# en: He makes every new clerk count aloud. He trusts people who measure twice.
text [4c5e9c] = 每个新店员都得被他逼着大声数数。他信得过量两遍的人。

@fact pell.daughters
# en: His daughters run the counter and want the shop to change; he wants it to be fifty years ago. They're all secretly proud of each other.
text [4a27be] = 女儿们管柜台，想让铺子变一变；他却希望一切停在五十年前。其实三个人都暗暗以彼此为傲。

@fact pell.spoon
# en: His brass measuring spoon hasn't been wrong in forty years. His daughters learned to measure on it, and say it's theirs.
text [dc3a46] = 他那把黄铜量勺四十年没出过错。他的女儿们是用它学会量药的，她们说勺子是她们的。
